{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10380","headline":"同房侍御山园新亭与邢判官同游 · 高适","name":"同房侍御山园新亭与邢判官同游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐隐春城外，朦胧陈迹深。\n君子顾榛莽，兴言伤古今。\n决河导新流，疏迳踪旧林。\n开亭俯川陆，时景宜招寻。\n肃穆逢使轩，夤缘事登临。\n忝游芝兰室，还对桃李阴。\n岸远白波来，气喧黄鸟吟。\n因睹歌颂作，始知经济心。\n灌坛有遗风，单父多鸣琴。\n谁爲久州县，苍生怀德音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}